<title>Ethiopia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ethiopia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ethiopia-2026-10-12T18:04:58.975Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 18:04:58 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Ethiopian forces have used drones to strike Eritrean troops that were backing Tigrayan rebels, while Eritrean soldiers have crossed into Ethiopian territory, prompting both sides to request UN deterrence or intervention. Ethiopian troops have moved into Adigrat in Tigray near the Eritrean border, and Ethiopia says it is acting in self-defence against Eritrean actions. Eritrea has called on the UN to intervene in the standoff and to take deterrence measures against Ethiopia. The conflict caused 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE1ON3JlRVNFa0FNbS05YUFhM2VTaFNDLUJHRTQybDViUmtCMzNvZEVIXzY5R2FOTTF6LXZoSHVxUTlZZi1tSUF3UkdfY2RRT0pCLUY3cXhxOXU?oc=5&quot;&gt;AFP Fact Check&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxOa3otdUpMV081a0ZSLTRCeHRwM2ZRV05qYi1nUHgtSHpjMnVPU2FXUV9jZ0JCYjFsTC1xN2lBUzNGTE9JeFNUMmlpV01pcnNkejk2TFdSMkp2WURRRWhNZloyRVRaTEYzamRTNXUwTV80ZkhoUE9OR1gwYWJVMUpwemhuMkVZT2dYLVF5NVUwSnJWNngtRFhJcDFHWkxjNmlDSDZEUlJ4R0hSQTBtN2JXb2s3MmUyaFBMSlJmNHc1WGdJVXEt?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxOQnBha3VpVVVrYTg2Wi1WLVJUQjRPNzNyaG1EYklBZFZuQ1A2T0hxRDFTMWJycnZjVm0zc2Q3dXR1OVBHdWh3elVBMHhxLS14RU9fcVJ4WkdqUGVZd05iVHJYU3BpcmRnbTlRdkZkcXpKX2pYZ0hIS00yOG0yMl9LaXBTSjVnaG9LQmhmTGp3dVRfbXFFQ1RtTTQ2NS10b3c5WkdwRmFHcklDdmxOSlNkT3hYS0dRRGZBM0JpWWtB0gG-AUFVX3lxTE9XT2JMLVBaekkxTy1OQ0w4R2d0bnk4SF85RlBwNDMzSE1BN1M5TmZaUVRsSFJsaE1BYjBmTnZ1TVRieUVPbVZIYmRNbHZzbmRsVXJ2cExLUVBxV2p4cnB0a3BJUHctbVc5bWJHRUQ1ZWgyNGFmZ0tCMGs2eUZhbWhwd2FtVWVnV2ZwbDhEcjRTRGlGWDZBMTBwRWtwTFBxNVd4Y3NzdS1pUGdfcE80b0lNb2hKVF